```

3. **Create a Factory/Registry**:
```java
@Component
public class AccountRetrieverFactory {
    private final Map<String, AccountRetriever<?>> retrievers;

    @Autowired
    public AccountRetrieverFactory(List<AccountRetriever<?>> retrievers) {
        this.retrievers = retrievers.stream()
            .collect(Collectors.toMap(
                AccountRetriever::getAccountType,
                Function.identity()
            ));
    }

    public AccountRetriever<?> getRetriever(String accountType) {
        return retrievers.get(accountType);
    }
}
```

4. **Service layer**:
